---

### ⚙️ Environment Variables for OIDC Authentication

Set these in your GitHub Actions workflow or repository secrets:

| Variable               | Description                          |
|------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| `ARM_CLIENT_ID`        | AppId of the Service Principal       |
| `ARM_SUBSCRIPTION_ID`  | Azure Subscription ID                |
| `ARM_TENANT_ID`        | Azure Tenant ID                      |

> 💡 Tip: Run `terraform init -backend-config=backend.dev.tfvars` to initialize the remote backend with your OIDC-enabled SP.
